<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="es">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
    <title>Pase no encontrado</title>
    <link rel="stylesheet" href="https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/bootstrap@5.3.3/dist/css/bootstrap.min.css">
    <style>
        body { background:#0f172a; color:#e2e8f0; min-height:100vh; display:flex; align-items:center; justify-content:center; }
        .card-error { background:#111827; border:1px solid #1e293b; border-radius:20px; padding:2.5rem; text-align:center; max-width:380px; }
    </style>
</head>
<body>
    <div class="card-error">
        <i class="bi bi-exclamation-triangle" style="font-size:3rem;color:#f87171;"></i>
        <h4 class="mt-3">Pase no encontrado</h4>
        <p class="text-muted">Este enlace no es válido o ya expiró. Contacta al residente que te invitó para obtener un nuevo pase.</p>
    </div>
    <link rel="stylesheet" href="https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/bootstrap-icons@1.11.3/font/bootstrap-icons.min.css">
</body>
</html>
